{"title":"People","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"People"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\nSo.Sta. is an interdisciplinary collaboration across statistics, social statistics and sociology. The profiles below link to each member’s personal or institutional webpage.\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/angela-andreella.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Angela Andreella\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Social Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://angeella.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Angela Andreella</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Statistical inference for complex and dependent data, resampling, multiple testing, mixed models and applications in health and social sciences.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/alberto-arletti.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Alberto Arletti\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Social Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/alberto.arletti\" target=\"_blank\">Alberto Arletti</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Statistical modelling for population health, morbidity trends, data integration and public-health applications.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/michele-bertani.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Michele Bertani\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Sociology</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/michele.bertani\" target=\"_blank\">Michele Bertani</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>General sociology, welfare, social policy and the study of complex social systems.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/gaia-bertarelli.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Gaia Bertarelli\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Social Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/gaia.bertarelli\" target=\"_blank\">Gaia Bertarelli</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Social statistics, health data, small-area estimation and methods for complex population data.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/stefano-campostrini.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Stefano Campostrini\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Social Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/stefano.campostrini\" target=\"_blank\">Stefano Campostrini</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Population health, surveillance systems, health inequalities, ageing and translation of statistical evidence into policy.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/michele-marzulli.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Michele Marzulli\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Sociology</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/michele.marzulli\" target=\"_blank\">Michele Marzulli</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Sociology of welfare, public policy, health systems, social innovation and inequalities.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/andrea-pastore.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Andrea Pastore\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/pastore\" target=\"_blank\">Andrea Pastore</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Statistical modelling and applied statistics, with work on health, ageing and morbidity.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/marta-pittavino.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Marta Pittavino\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Social Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/marta.pittavino\" target=\"_blank\">Marta Pittavino</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Applied and social statistics, health and population data, statistical modelling and inference.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/lorenzo-schiavon.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Lorenzo Schiavon\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://lorenzo-schiavon.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Lorenzo Schiavon</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">University of Padova</div>\n<p>Bayesian statistics, latent-variable models, complex and high-dimensional data.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/mattia-stival.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Mattia Stival\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Social Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/stivalmat/\" target=\"_blank\">Mattia Stival</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Bayesian modelling, repeated cross-sectional surveys, spatial and temporal heterogeneity, public-health applications.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/stefano-tonellato.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Stefano Tonellato\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Statistics</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:.15em 0\"><a href=\"https://www.unive.it/people/stone\" target=\"_blank\">Stefano Tonellato</a></h3>\n<div class=\"meta\">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice</div>\n<p>Statistical modelling, time series, computational statistics and complex data.</p>\n</div>\n</article>","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\nSo.Sta. is an interdisciplinary collaboration across statistics, social statistics and sociology. The profiles below link to each member’s personal or institutional webpage.\n\n<article class=\"card\" style=\"margin:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center\">\n<img src=\"images/people/angela-andreella.png\" alt=\"Placeholder portrait for Angela Andreella\" style=\"width:140px;height:140px;object-fit:co